# Kept out of the shinyapps.io bundle. The app needs app.R, R/, inst/ and
# spec/ -- nothing else. DESCRIPTION and NAMESPACE stay out so rsconnect and
# shiny treat this as an app, not a half-installed package, and the original
# report HTML (real cohort aggregates) never leaves the repo.
.git
.github
.dockerignore
.Rbuildignore
CLAUDE.md
DESCRIPTION
Dockerfile
LICENSE
NAMESPACE
README.md
VITAL_HMB_Descriptive_Analysis.html
data-raw
deploy
renv.lock
run_report.R
run_report_standalone.R
tests
